/** ACC-009 offline candidate. OWNER CLI only. NOT_REVIEWED: no execution release.
 * WP3c rollback SQL is generated with exact newly inserted IDs into its private
 * backup. It removes only owned metadata/setting rows; customer/order JSON is
 * never changed. Source rollback cannot undo later customer edits or NP effects.
